F%2F%2F%20a%20parse%20well%20inside%20it.%0Aconst%20PARSE_STACK%3A%20usize%20%3D%20256%20%2A%201024%20%2A%201024%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%2F%20The%20limits%20and%20policies%20of%20a%20parse.%20Every%20field%20left%20%60None%60%20keeps%20the%0A%2F%2F%2F%20value%20the%20parser%20was%20compiled%20with%2C%20and%20then%20the%20default.%0A%23%5Bderive%28Clone%2C%20Debug%2C%20Default%2C%20PartialEq%2C%20Eq%29%5D%0Apub%20struct%20FeatureParseOptions%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20Explicit%20root%20grammar%20identity%20for%20a%20stored%20qualified%20invocation.%0A%20%20%20%20pub%20grammar_name%3A%20Option%3CString%3E%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20Existing%20checked%20global%20concept%20space%2C%20including%20definitions%20and%20origins.%0A%20%20%20%20pub%20global_concept_space%3A%20Option%3Cserde_json%3A%3AValue%3E%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20The%20rule%20to%20parse%20from%20instead%20of%20the%20grammar%27s%20start%20rule.%0A%20%20%20%20pub%20start_rule%3A%20Option%3CString%3E%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20The%20bound%20on%20nested%20rule%20calls%20%28default%201000%29.%0A%20%20%20%20pub%20max_depth%3A%20Option%3Cusize%3E%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20The%20bound%20on%20evaluation%20steps%20%28default%20%60100000%20%2B%201000%20%2A%20input%20length%60%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20twice%20that%20with%20error%20recovery%29.%0A%20%20%20%20pub%20step_limit%3A%20Option%3Cusize%3E%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20The%20bound%20on%20memoized%20rule%20calls%20%28default%201000000%29.%0A%20%20%20%20pub%20memo_limit%3A%20Option%3Cusize%3E%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20The%20memory%20budget%20of%20the%20whole%20parse%2C%20its%20runs%2C%20repair%20rounds%20and%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20embedded%20languages%20included%2C%20in%20memo%20cells%3A%20one%20per%20rule%20call%20recorded%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20and%20one%20per%20result%20such%20a%20call%20keeps%2C%20counted%20and%20never%20released.%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20Fixed%20lexical%20cache%20cells%20also%20count%20while%20retained%3B%20those%20option